OL,3,ATrump threatens to stop sale of
OL,4,ACanadian Bombardier jets in US
OL,5,
OL,6,FPresident Donald Trump has warned
OL,7,FCanadian aircraft company Bombardier
OL,8,Fthat it can no longer sell in the US
OL,9,Funless it moves its manufacturing
OL,10,Fthere.
OL,12,F"NO MORE SELLING BOMBARDIER IN THE
OL,13,FUNITED STATES!" Trump wrote in a Truth
OL,14,FSocial post on Monday. "If they want
OL,15,Four Market, they must build here, and
OL,16,Fstop treating America like a
OL,17,F'piggybank'."
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
