OL,3,ATrump threatens to stop sale of
OL,4,ACanadian Bombardier jets in US
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe move comes amid an escalating trade
OL,7,Fwar between the two neighbours, and
OL,8,Fhours before Canadian retaliatory
OL,9,Ftariffs are set to be imposed on $20bn
OL,10,F(#14.7bn) worth of US goods.
OL,12,FIn a statement, Bombardier underscored
OL,13,Fthat it employed thousands of American
OL,14,Fworkers and said it valued its
OL,15,Fpartnerships with American companies.
